## Buggy Version Identification
Issue text explains that PR #2917 made relative mount destinations an error and PR #3004 relaxed the validation to a warning. Git log matched `b31a9340f92b` (`libcontainer: relax validation for absolute paths`); parent `dbb35411f80a` is the strict-error buggy baseline.

